description:
That's one tough mom! 
@10:10 Mom showed she's a total class act!
@6:23 Mom made it clear her child was rear facing. Had he not been rear facing, he could have sustained a serious neck injury given the forces involved in this crash.

"The statements of witnesses, the lack of apparent braking prior to impact, the driver's level of impairment and his status upon arrival of officers are all suggestive the driver fell asleep or lost consciousness prior to impact."
